@startuml
title Logout

actor Client
participant "Express Router" as Router
participant "AuthController\n(ctrl.logout)" as Ctrl
participant "AuthService\n(svc.logout)" as Svc
database "MongoDB" as DB

Client -> Router: POST /logout { refreshToken }
Router -> Ctrl: ctrl.logout(req, res)
Ctrl -> Svc: logout({ refreshToken })

Svc -> Svc: fingerprint = fpRefresh(refreshToken)
Svc -> DB: Session.findOne({ refresh_fingerprint: fingerprint,\n revoked_at: {$exists:false} })
DB --> Svc: session

Svc -> Svc: so khớp refreshToken với session.refresh_token_hash\n(match = true)

Svc -> DB: session.revoked_at = now\nsession.revoked_reason = "logout"\nsession.save()
DB --> Svc: saved

Svc --> Ctrl: { ok: true }
Ctrl --> Client: 200 JSON { ok: true }

@enduml
